In this folder boxes for simulating and refning water can be found.
Boxes were done using SPCE water-model but can be suitable even for other water-models with 3 sites, 
like TIP3p, for example, SPC.

There are 3 PDB-files:
- 27WATERS.pdb
- 64WATERS.pdb
- 125WATERS.pdb

Files are named after the number of water molecules in them.
